This repository archives the PC-1403 adaptations developed with Philippe
Cavenel in October 2026: macOS port, Windows BASIC conversion and serial
protocol changes, continuous Arduino cassette streaming, and examples.
An experimental Linux port was added on 6 October 2026, derived from macOS
V5.2, with Linux USB discovery, English diagnostics and Ubuntu build scripts.
See docs/MODIFICATIONS.md for changes and docs/PUBLICATION.md for license scope.
Archive source code and firmware retain their original delivered bytes,
including all existing copyright and attribution notices. README and LIRE-MOI
documentation was translated into English on 6 October 2026. Its original text
is retained in Git history; the manifest records original and current checksums.
This NOTICE does not change any component's license.

